# Recorded simulation data (cassettes, world logs) stays local by
# default; the Calder epoch cassettes are committed as the standing
# determinism dataset (reviewed: prompts + completions only, no
# credentials of any kind).
# These paths said `src/workbench/workplaces/**` and the tree has been
# `src/workplaces/**` since the package was flattened, so the rules
# matched nothing at all. Calder's cassettes stayed committed for the
# right reason by accident, and every other cassette -- including a
# scratch 4.9MB pilot recording -- was one `git add -A` from the index.
src/workplaces/**/cassettes/
!src/workplaces/calder/cassettes/
!src/workplaces/calder/cassettes/**
# Scratch recordings made outside a workplace package.
/cassettes/
datasets/**/bundle/
datasets/**/.workbench/

# Harbor job output (trajectories, rewards, artifacts)
jobs/
datasets/*/tasks/*/tests/criteria_base.py
datasets/merrick/tasks/*/tests/answer/
datasets/merrick/tasks/*/tests/process/
datasets/merrick/tasks/*/tests/test.sh
